<section id="body-weight" class="health-panel hub-records" aria-labelledby="weight-title" data-health-base="{{ relativeUrl('/admin/health/api') }}">
    <div class="section-title"><div><h2 id="weight-title">体重，慢慢靠近目标。</h2><p class="subtle small">保留每次变化，和睡眠、运动一起回顾。</p></div><span class="source-pill">身体记录</span></div>
    <div class="weight-layout"><div><div id="weight-metrics" class="compact-metrics"></div><div id="weight-chart" class="mini-chart" aria-label="体重历史趋势"></div><div id="weight-history" class="weight-history"></div></div><form id="weight-form" class="weight-form"><label>记录日期<input name="date" type="date" required></label><label>体重（kg）<input name="weightKg" type="number" min="1" max="500" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="填入测量值" required></label><label style="grid-column:1/-1">备注（可选）<input name="notes" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：晨起空腹"></label><button class="hub-button primary" type="submit" disabled>记录体重</button><p id="weight-status" class="weight-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="weight-review" class="hub-button" type="button" hidden>读取最新记录并核对</button></form></div>
</section>
<section id="zepp-daily" class="health-panel hub-records" aria-labelledby="zepp-daily-title"><div class="section-title"><div><h2 id="zepp-daily-title">手表记录的每一天</h2><p class="subtle small">心率、活动与身体指标，保留来源与数据缺口。</p></div><button id="body-zepp-sync" type="button" class="hub-button">同步详细数据</button></div><p id="body-zepp-status" class="weight-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在读取…</p><div id="body-daily-records"></div><button type="button" id="daily-more" class="hub-button" hidden>显示更多记录</button></section>
